      "title": "[MEDIA-v0.0.3-acceptance] Complete v0.0.3 release acceptance",
      "body": "## Outcome and scope\n\n- [ ] All **P0** issues closed ([#1](https://github.com/HFDWKJ/APP-media-management/issues/1)\u2013[#5](https://github.com/HFDWKJ/APP-media-management/issues/5))\n- [ ] `MediaManagerSetup_0.0.3.exe` and `MediaManagerPortal_v0.0.3.zip` built with Nuitka and uploaded to [Release v0.0.3](https://github.com/HFDWKJ/APP-media-management/releases)\n- [ ] Dated `.log/` release record added and `CHANGELOG.md` index updated; About dialog shows 0.0.3 notes\n- [ ] Silent update path tested: 0.0.2 \u2192 0.0.3 (installed + portable)\n- [ ] No open **P0** issues on milestone v0.0.3\n\nThe existing release/tag and closed issues remain historical facts. This issue carries the unchecked release acceptance checklist without claiming that a future release must be republished.\n\n## Completion evidence\n\n- [ ] Confirm the bounded scope and current baseline before execution.\n- [ ] Link the resulting change or decision and its verification evidence.\n- [ ] Record actual acceptance and remaining limits; implementation alone is not runtime acceptance.\n\n## Provenance\n\nMigrated from [the preserved source](https://github.com/HFDWKJ/APP-media-management/blob/5312cb7992f3b532e9f56f4bf8f3a172182f9e45/.rec/Roadmap.md). Source reference: `MEDIA-v0.0.3-acceptance`. Original history and identifiers remain unchanged.\n\nCreating this issue records planned work; it does not execute native operations, enrollments, purchases, deployments, credential changes, or installed synchronization.\n\n<!-- github-native-adoption:20261114:MEDIA-v0.0.3-acceptance -->\n",
